1
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:29,250
[Live Forever]

2
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:32,930
[Episode 9]

3
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:41,430
Your Highness.

4
00:00:41,430 --> 00:00:44,240
Are you trying to elope?

5
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:52,640
Isn't this Lord Ning of the Yulin Guard?

6
00:00:56,390 --> 00:00:57,050
Don't come any closer,

7
00:00:57,050 --> 00:00:58,010
or I'll kill her!

8
00:00:58,970 --> 00:00:59,830
Ning Changyue.

9
00:01:00,710 --> 00:01:01,750
Cut the crap.

10
00:01:01,750 --> 00:01:04,950
Lord Ning, are you trying
to hold the princess hostage?

11
00:01:05,810 --> 00:01:07,140
Since you've caught us,

12
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:08,590
and I can't take her away alive,

13
00:01:08,590 --> 00:01:09,990
then we'll die together!

14
00:01:12,900 --> 00:01:14,770
Ning Changyue! Ning Changyue!

15
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:16,050
Let me go!

16
00:01:22,710 --> 00:01:25,480
What a tragic drama
of star-crossed lovers.

17
00:01:26,430 --> 00:01:27,680
In the past,

18
00:01:27,730 --> 00:01:29,010
if I were in a good mood,

19
00:01:29,430 --> 00:01:31,630
I might have let you two go off together.

20
00:01:32,150 --> 00:01:33,400
But now,

21
00:01:33,950 --> 00:01:34,789
what a pity.

22
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:39,229
You, a princess out of favor,

23
00:01:39,229 --> 00:01:41,090
have caught the eye of General Yu.

24
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:42,710
So today,

25
00:01:42,789 --> 00:01:44,870
I have no choice but to be the bad guy

26
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:47,039
who breaks you two

27
00:01:47,950 --> 00:01:48,789
apart.

28
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:58,440
Princess Ningjia, receive the edict.

29
00:02:04,350 --> 00:02:05,400
By the grace of Heaven,

30
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:06,790
the Emperor decrees:

31
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:09,630
Princess Ningjia
is gentle and intelligent.

32
00:02:09,789 --> 00:02:12,830
General Yu is unparalleled
in loyalty and bravery.

33
00:02:12,850 --> 00:02:14,250
They are a perfect match.

34
00:02:14,510 --> 00:02:16,130
I hereby grant them marriage,

35
00:02:16,130 --> 00:02:19,310
to be wed on the auspicious day,
the eighth day of the third lunar month,

36
00:02:19,310 --> 00:02:20,910
to show my special favor.

37
00:02:21,620 --> 00:02:23,100
Respect this.

38
00:02:26,050 --> 00:02:28,400
I won't marry him. I won't marry him.

39
00:02:28,710 --> 00:02:30,079
Let me go!

40
00:02:30,140 --> 00:02:31,000
Let me go!

41
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:32,280
I won't marry him!

42
00:02:32,630 --> 00:02:33,120
Song Yiqiu!

43
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:34,280
Let me go!

44
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:35,590
Let me go!

45
00:02:35,590 --> 00:02:36,630
Your Highness, it seems you

46
00:02:36,630 --> 00:02:39,430
have been led astray by some scum.

47
00:03:06,470 --> 00:03:07,630
Your Highness.

48
00:03:08,260 --> 00:03:09,820
Now you know

49
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:15,300
♪ Fate is hard to write,
with karma left incomplete ♪

50
00:03:10,630 --> 00:03:12,230
what you should do, right?

51
00:03:15,890 --> 00:03:22,610
♪ Past lives burn away at dusk,
old memories fade cold ♪

52
00:03:23,430 --> 00:03:30,020
♪ Across lifetimes, my longing remains,
leaving no regret ♪

53
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:37,620
♪ 3,000 years cannot undo
the bitterness of one endless cycle ♪

54
00:03:37,650 --> 00:03:39,680
♪ Watching time flow ♪

55
00:03:39,710 --> 00:03:41,590
♪ Hearing the years sigh softly ♪

56
00:03:41,610 --> 00:03:44,370
♪ Immortality still
cannot bring fulfillment ♪

57
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:46,560
♪ Let fate tear everything apart ♪

58
00:03:46,590 --> 00:03:48,460
♪ Our bond exists only because ♪

59
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:51,590
♪ I don't want to leave regrets behind ♪

60
00:03:51,970 --> 00:03:55,760
♪ I'd forsake immortality
to share your joys and sorrows ♪

61
00:03:55,780 --> 00:03:58,790
♪ Don't ask how absurd the ending may be ♪

62
00:03:58,829 --> 00:04:01,110
♪ I only want to use this lifetime ♪

63
00:04:01,130 --> 00:04:04,490
♪ To trade it for eternity ♪

64
00:04:04,520 --> 00:04:08,120
♪ Could we find our happy ending? ♪

65
00:04:08,750 --> 00:04:12,120
A lowly wretch dares to covet royalty.

66
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:15,240
Go back to where you came from.

67
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:17,600
Take this sinner

68
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,720
to test the medicine.

69
00:04:22,190 --> 00:04:23,240
What are you yelling about?

70
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:23,920
Shut up.

71
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,600
Stop yelling.

72
00:04:26,310 --> 00:04:27,000
Shut up.

73
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:28,530
Stop crying.

74
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:32,250
I'm talking to him, not you.

75
00:04:32,310 --> 00:04:32,870
Hurry up.

76
00:04:33,070 --> 00:04:33,510
Hurry.

77
00:04:36,870 --> 00:04:37,730
No more crying.

78
00:04:37,870 --> 00:04:38,430
Hurry.

79
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,850
Stop shouting. Stop shouting.

80
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:44,510
Hurry.

81
00:04:54,510 --> 00:04:55,120
Move.

82
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:56,630
Why are you just standing there?

83
00:04:56,630 --> 00:04:57,159
Hurry up.

84
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,480
Legend has it

85
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:15,560
the Tree Spirit's inner core
can bring the dead back to life,

86
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:18,220
restore flesh to bones,
and grant immortality.

87
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:19,800
Hand over the inner core,

88
00:05:21,310 --> 00:05:23,440
and you won't have to suffer like this.

89
00:05:30,660 --> 00:05:32,270
How dare you ignore me.

90
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:34,720
Drain her blood.

91
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:35,800
-Yes.
-Yes.

92
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:07,600
Song Yiqiu.

93
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,680
Run.

94
00:06:13,310 --> 00:06:15,430
Come on.

95
00:06:15,450 --> 00:06:17,560
Today is Princess Ningjia's wedding day.

96
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,600
This is a gift from the higher-ups.

97
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,510
Drink up,

98
00:06:19,510 --> 00:06:20,510
and share the joy.

99
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:22,430
Come on.

100
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:25,430
Isn't this

101
00:06:25,430 --> 00:06:27,630
Lord Ning, who was beaten half to death?

102
00:06:29,190 --> 00:06:30,240
Lord Ning,

103
00:06:30,510 --> 00:06:32,170
do you want some wedding wine?

104
00:06:35,750 --> 00:06:36,390
Come on.

105
00:06:36,390 --> 00:06:37,190
Fill it up for me again.

106
00:06:37,190 --> 00:06:39,190
A toad dares to dream of a swan.

107
00:06:39,630 --> 00:06:40,600
I haven't felt this good in a long time.

108
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:43,040
The woman you love
is marrying someone else.

109
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,300
Why aren't you crying?

110
00:06:46,830 --> 00:06:48,159
Come on, guys.

111
00:06:48,159 --> 00:06:49,600
-Let's drink.
-Okay.

112
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,720
Come here.

113
00:06:51,630 --> 00:06:52,750
Bottoms up.

114
00:06:53,390 --> 00:06:54,600
I don't deserve her.

115
00:06:56,630 --> 00:06:58,190
I never did.

116
00:06:59,550 --> 00:07:01,400
She is the moon in the sky,

117
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:04,600
and I am the mud on the ground.

118
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,790
Let's get drunk, bro.

119
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:23,090
Go get a pot of hot tea for the Princess.

120
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:37,840
Your Highness, it's me.

121
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:40,510
Xiaoyuan.

122
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:41,900
Your Highness,

123
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:42,930
there's no time.

124
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:46,270
I'll take you out of the palace
according to Lord Ning's backup plan.

125
00:07:46,270 --> 00:07:46,920
Xiaoyuan,

126
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:48,180
if they find out

127
00:07:48,390 --> 00:07:50,250
you let me go, you'll be beheaded.

128
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:52,050
Lord Ning helped me.

129
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:54,540
His wish is to help you escape the palace.

130
00:07:54,540 --> 00:07:56,540
I will also escape during the chaos.

131
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,620
Take this identity token

132
00:07:58,620 --> 00:08:00,180
and go out through the west corner gate.

133
00:08:00,180 --> 00:08:02,180
Lord Ning has arranged everything.

134
00:08:02,310 --> 00:08:04,390
The carriage, travel documents, and route

135
00:08:04,390 --> 00:08:05,680
are all at the usual place.

136
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,480
Your Highness,

137
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:08,090
I calculated the time before I came

138
00:08:08,090 --> 00:08:09,970
and left a pile of firewood
at the east corner gate.

139
00:08:09,970 --> 00:08:11,540
Taking advantage
of the chaos caused by the fire,

140
00:08:11,540 --> 00:08:13,000
no one will recognize you.

141
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:14,850
Your Highness, go quickly.

142
00:08:14,880 --> 00:08:16,790
No, I can't.

143
00:08:18,470 --> 00:08:19,330
Your Highness,

144
00:08:19,830 --> 00:08:22,780
the world is vast once you escape.

145
00:08:22,870 --> 00:08:25,920
I hope your wishes come true.

146
00:08:31,830 --> 00:08:33,150
Song Yiqiu,

147
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,909
you must escape.

148
00:08:37,030 --> 00:08:39,030
The world outside is vast.

149
00:08:40,150 --> 00:08:41,360
I hope

150
00:08:42,750 --> 00:08:44,600
your wishes come true.

151
00:08:50,590 --> 00:08:51,440
Come on.

152
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,630
There's a fire!

153
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:54,630
Fire!

154
00:08:54,630 --> 00:08:57,000
Somebody help! There's a fire!

155
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:58,720
Fire!

156
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:00,120
Look over there!

157
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:01,270
There really is a fire.

158
00:09:01,270 --> 00:09:01,870
Fire!

159
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:02,720
Really!

160
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:04,030
Let me out!

161
00:09:04,030 --> 00:09:04,750
Go!

162
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:07,000
Help! Hurry!

163
00:09:07,510 --> 00:09:09,150
Don't just stand there. Run!

164
00:09:11,670 --> 00:09:12,480
Run!

165
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,320
Hurry up!

166
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:17,270
Somebody!

167
00:09:17,510 --> 00:09:18,600
Help!

168
00:09:25,630 --> 00:09:26,910
Somebody help!

169
00:09:29,430 --> 00:09:30,520
The fire is so big.

170
00:09:31,590 --> 00:09:33,790
She'll definitely escape in the chaos.

171
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:47,960
Do you know where the prison is?

172
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:49,130
Your Highness, you can't go.

173
00:09:49,130 --> 00:09:50,300
That's a dead end.

174
00:09:53,030 --> 00:09:54,760
This is also the freedom I want.

175
00:10:00,020 --> 00:10:01,140
Song Yiqiu.

176
00:10:06,010 --> 00:10:07,730
Let us out!

177
00:10:07,760 --> 00:10:09,190
Go! Hurry!

178
00:10:11,270 --> 00:10:12,000
Run!

179
00:10:15,390 --> 00:10:16,050
Over there!

180
00:10:26,510 --> 00:10:28,230
Let us out!

181
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:33,440
Help me! Help me!

182
00:10:33,740 --> 00:10:34,910
Please help me!

183
00:10:35,670 --> 00:10:37,080
Help!

184
00:10:38,870 --> 00:10:40,200
The door is open! Hurry!

185
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,030
Run!

186
00:10:41,030 --> 00:10:42,120
Run!

187
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,120
Help us!

188
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:49,240
Let us out!

189
00:10:51,150 --> 00:10:52,120
Hurry! Hurry!

190
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,470
Song Yiqiu.

191
00:11:23,550 --> 00:11:24,670
Why are you here?

192
00:11:26,890 --> 00:11:27,940
Go.

193
00:11:28,030 --> 00:11:29,230
Don't worry about me.

194
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:37,720
Let's go. Hurry up.

195
00:11:38,870 --> 00:11:39,550
Let's go!

196
00:11:40,270 --> 00:11:40,960
Hurry.

197
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:44,480
Let's go!

198
00:11:46,150 --> 00:11:47,030
Let's go!

199
00:11:47,030 --> 00:11:48,120
I can't walk.

200
00:11:48,670 --> 00:11:50,590
You can't leave if you take me.

201
00:11:51,030 --> 00:11:53,440
No, no.

202
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:55,120
Leave me alone and go.

203
00:11:58,010 --> 00:11:59,010
No.

204
00:12:22,190 --> 00:12:23,220
Song Yiqiu.

205
00:12:24,520 --> 00:12:26,550
You could have escaped in the chaos.

206
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:30,790
Why did you come back?

207
00:12:56,390 --> 00:12:58,240
Our lives have been tied together

208
00:12:58,240 --> 00:13:01,390
since you taught me how to draw a bow.

209
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:07,550
If we live, we live together.

210
00:13:14,160 --> 00:13:16,710
If we die, we die together.

211
00:13:58,840 --> 00:13:59,750
This is...

212
00:14:01,670 --> 00:14:03,360
Their bond

213
00:14:04,450 --> 00:14:06,780
actually generated a spiritual pill.

214
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:13,200
Eat it.

215
00:14:18,480 --> 00:14:19,630
Maybe you can get a chance

216
00:14:19,630 --> 00:14:21,510
to be together forever.

217
00:15:01,780 --> 00:15:03,270
Pass on my decree:

218
00:15:03,790 --> 00:15:05,990
The traitors Ningjia and Ning Changyue

219
00:15:06,280 --> 00:15:07,740
released the Tree Spirit.

220
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,840
Kill them without mercy!

221
00:15:13,510 --> 00:15:14,200
Stop!

222
00:15:14,390 --> 00:15:15,080
After them!

223
00:15:16,670 --> 00:15:17,360
Over there!

224
00:15:17,910 --> 00:15:18,670
Watch out!

225
00:15:19,510 --> 00:15:20,630
Hurry! Hyah!

226
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:24,450
That's a cliff. They can't escape now.

227
00:15:26,520 --> 00:15:28,120
Let's go! Hurry!

228
00:15:32,630 --> 00:15:33,510
Your Highness,

229
00:15:33,880 --> 00:15:35,310
this is a dead end.

230
00:15:35,750 --> 00:15:37,080
You have nowhere to run.

231
00:15:57,540 --> 00:15:58,580
Are you afraid?

232
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:02,020
As long as I'm by your side,

233
00:16:02,560 --> 00:16:04,290
I have nothing left to wish for.

234
00:16:14,670 --> 00:16:15,510
Song Yiqiu,

235
00:16:16,360 --> 00:16:17,630
from this day forward,

236
00:16:18,910 --> 00:16:21,310
from the heavens above
to the depths below,

237
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:22,780
may it always be you and me,

238
00:16:23,670 --> 00:16:24,750
never to part.

239
00:16:26,550 --> 00:16:27,510
We

240
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:29,960
will never part.
